# Vren only replaces a creature on the battlefield dying: "Cards that would go to your opponent's graveyard for reasons other than
# dying, such as being discarded or milled, will still go to the graveyard". Bot1 casts Vren on turn 1; on turn 3 Thoughtseize makes Bot2 discard
# the Llanowar Elves card from its hand. It lands in Bot2's graveyard, not exile, and a card discarded from the hand was not exiled
# from the battlefield, so there is no Rat at the end step.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Black Lotus
Vren, the Relentless
Thoughtseize
Mox Jet
Island
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Llanowar Elves
Forest x17

