Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Red)
Bot1.Hand.Vren, the Relentless.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Forest.Play
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet#2.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Thoughtseize.Cast(Bot2)
Bot1.Choose(Llanowar Elves)
